  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n30% of 50% of (2 ÷ 3) of number = 325\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nPercentage = value ÷ 100\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ Let number = x\n\n⇒ 30% of 50% of (2 ÷ 3)x = 325\n\n⇒ (30 ÷ 100) × (50 ÷ 100) × (2 ÷ 3) × x = 325\n\n⇒ (3 ÷ 10) × (1 ÷ 2) × (2 ÷ 3) × x = 325\n\n⇒ (1 ÷ 10) × x = 325\n\n⇒ x = 325 × 10\n\n⇒ x = 3250\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 3250.**",
